category: Libs
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Small C library for RFC 1413 Identification protocol (utilities)"
ldesc: "LibIdent is a small C library for interfacing with RFC 1413 Identification
protocol servers, which are used for identifying users. LibIdent supports both
IPv4 and IPv6 addresses transparently."
